  "status": "formal",
  "supportedClaim": "Step 18 proves the exact fixed-deletion hierarchy and a target-scale equivalence between fixed hybrid height and simultaneous completed-clock height after known payments. Exact disjoint triangular clocks separate moving from fixed deletion and simultaneous from coordinatewise maxima. At fixed deletion budget, the full-ledger-normalized fixed height grows like H^(1/3), so the inherited abstract linear ledger does not imply the desired 2/3-power estimate."
}
